{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dystopian future ruled by ruthless corporations, Special Agent Seth embarks on a mission to uncover why a secretive mining base for a new biological gas has gone silent. A nightmare awaits him: the gas has transformed the workers and nearby townsfolk into bloodthirsty zombies! <br>Fight through hordes of enemies, unravel the corporation\u2019s dark conspiracy, and face Lovecraftian monsters in this fast-paced retro FPS with survival horror elements!<br>Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, industrial retro vibe inspired by classic FPS games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management: ammo, meds, and food\u2014every decision counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player vital stats system that impacts gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental analysis system highlighting key items and mission objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex logical and environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique blend of Lovecraftian mythology and dark sci-fi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack that heightens tension.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998990?t=1768650543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/d54a6dc9a74f31a0168c9e68555568ec4d7373d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768650543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/555142ec23ceb6ecb2736f9557482892b453e577/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768650543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/555142ec23ceb6ecb2736f9557482892b453e577/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768650543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[